        "Scope mismatch: § 11.3 is an acceptable-use/content-warranty enforcement right (IBM may investigate suspected unlawful, infringing or abusive Content and then remove/suspend), not a usage or fee-compliance audit. The AUDIT rule is framed around verification of our usage with an underpayment true-up ('independent auditor', 'underpayment exceeds 5%/10%'), so importing it wholesale here misapplies the rule; the absence of any true usage/licence audit right is favourable to us and should not be raised as a deviation.",
